": "40cfe5a", "box": "background-color:transparent;padding:20px 10px 20px 10px;border-radius:2px 2px 2px 2px"}, {"type": "image", "src": "/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/Full-Coverage-Paint-Protection-in-Toronto-3M-and-XPEL.webp", "alt": "Full Coverage Paint Protection in Toronto - 3M and XPEL", "width": "800", "height": "480", "href": null, "full": false, "eid": "d7a042e"}, {"type": "heading", "level": 2, "text": "Covers the entire vehicle for overall protection. Recommended for luxury cars.", "href": null, "style": "text-align:center;font-family:\"Poppins\", Sans-serif;line-height:1.3em;color:#4B4F58;font-weight:400", "tag": "p", "eid": "9d34614"}, {"type": "button", "text": "Get a Quote", "href": "#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dpopup%3Aopen%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6IjE3NTY0IiwidG9nZ2xlIjpmYWxzZX0%3D", "icon": null, "style": "text-align:center;font-family:\"Poppins\", Sans-serif;color:#FFFFFF;font-weight:500", "eid": "d141f7c"}], "padding": null, "maxWidth": null, "minHeight": null, "background": "var( --e-global-color-d077a13 )", "bgImage": null, "bgSize": null, "bgPosition": null, "bgRepeat": null}, {"id": "ffa4317", "blocks": [{"type": "heading", "level": 2, "text": "FAQs", "href": null, "style": "text-align:center;font-family:\"Poppins\", Sans-serif;color:var( --e-global-color-8c22d81 );font-weight:600;text-transform:capitalize", "eid": "a1ab714"}, {"type": "faq", "items": [{"q": "What is Paint Protection Film (PPF)?", "a": "<p>Paint Protection Film, or PPF, is a virtually invisible, self-healing layer applied to your vehicle’s exterior to protect it from scratches, chips, and other damage, all while maintaining its original appearance.</p>"}, {"q": "How long does the PPF installation process take?", "a": "<p>The duration of the installation depends on the size and type of your vehicle. Typically, it can take a day for a standard car, but our team will provide a more precise estimate upon evaluation.</p>"}, {"q": "Can PPF be applied to any type of vehicle?", "a": "<p>Yes, PPF can be applied to various types of vehicles, including cars, motorcycles, boats, and even planes. Our tailored solutions cater to all vehicle categories.</p>"}, {"q": "Is PPF easy to clean and maintain?", "a": "<p>Yes, PPF is easy to clean and maintain. You can wash your vehicle as usual, and the film’s protective barrier ensures that your car maintains its original shine.</p>"}, {"q": "Will PPF affect the appearance of my car?", "a": "<p>No, PPF is optically clear and doesn’t affect the look of your vehicle. It preserves your car’s original finish while offering protection.</p>"}, {"q": "Can PPF be removed without damaging the paint?", "a": "<p>Absolutely. Unlike many other brands, our 3M Pro film can be removed without leaving any damage to the paint.</p>"}, {"q": "How long does PPF last, and is it backed by a warranty?", "a": "<p>Our 3M Pro PPF comes with a 10-year warranty against cracking, bubbling, and yellowing. It is designed to be long-lasting, offering you peace of mind.</p>"}, {"q": "Does PPF protect against stone chips and minor dents?", "a": "<p>Yes, PPF offers protection against stone chips, most scratches, and even minor dents, keeping your vehicle’s exterior in excellent condition.</p>"}, {"q": "Can PPF heal minor scratches on its own?", "a": "<p>Yes, in warm weather, minor scratches in the top coat of PPF have a self-healing property, maintaining the film’s clarity and appearance.</p>"}, {"q": "How can I schedule an appointment or request a quote?", "a": "<p>You can easily schedule an appointment or request a quote by reaching out to our team through our contact information provided on our website. We’re here to assist you in preserving your vehicle’s beauty and protection.</p>"}], "eid": "2735df8"}], "padding": null, "maxWidth": null, "minHeight": null, "background": null, "bgImage": null, "bgSize": null, "bgPosition": null, "bgRepeat": null}, {"id": "8d5b45c", "blocks": [{"type": "heading", "level": 2, "text": "Get an Estimate", "href": nul